> FAQs (10 questions): keep the current brief FAQs, but replace the loose skin FAQ or shorten the lower-priority questions to add: "What is the 30/30 rule after gastric bypass?", "Can gastric bypass be covered by Medicare?", and "How much does gastric bypass cost in Perth?"

