    44	
    45	<span class="mark">If a cycle of weight loss and regain feels like a
    46	permanent fixture in your life, you are not alone in considering weight
    47	loss surgery as an alternative. Gastric bypass surgery is one of the
    48	oldest, most well-known bariatric procedures in Australia, with the
    49	Roux-en-Y gastric bypass being the most common and often the preferred
    50	option for those managing associated health conditions such as type 2
    51	diabetes or gastro-oesophageal reflux disease (GORD) in addition to
    52	overweight or obesity.</span>
