   115	Each bullet conveys one clear, qualified benefit. No superlatives.
   116	
   117	1. Significant, durable weight loss — clinical averages around 70–80% of excess weight, though individual results vary.
   118	2. Strong improvement in type 2 diabetes in many patients — some are able to reduce or stop medication after discussion with their doctor; outcomes vary between individuals.
   119	3. Often relieves acid reflux and heartburn, unlike some procedures that can worsen it.
   120	4. Improvement in conditions linked to excess weight — high blood pressure, sleep apnoea, joint pain.
   121	5. Long-term hormonal changes that reduce constant hunger, making healthier eating feel more achievable rather than a daily battle.
