content-briefs/gastric-bypass-perth.md:126:- **Intro paragraph tone:** Acknowledge directly that the bypass is safe and well-established in experienced hands, but that no surgery is without risk. The patient deserves the full picture before deciding. Most patients recover without serious complications, but the points below are what every patient is told before proceeding. The surgeon will discuss how each applies individually.
