content-briefs/gastric-bypass-perth.md:137:- Total cost depends on private health cover, surgeon and anaesthetist fees, and length of hospital stay — varies by individual.
content-briefs/gastric-bypass-perth.md-138-- Rather than quoting a single figure that may not apply, the practice provides a clear, itemised written estimate before any decision is made.
content-briefs/gastric-bypass-perth.md:139:- Medicare and most private health funds with appropriate hospital cover contribute towards bariatric surgery.
content-briefs/gastric-bypass-perth.md-140-- Some patients access superannuation through early release to help with out-of-pocket costs.
