docs/oswa/content-review-2026-07/review/_worklog/bariatric-surgery-perth-codex.md-181-- **Blocking #1/#2 (semaglutide / GLP-1 promotion) — partially BRIEF-INHERITED and a policy decision.** The brief's own semantic terms and section 6 mandate "GLP-1 medical weight management" coverage. TGA guidance captures direct AND indirect references to prescription-medicine classes (incl. GLP-1/weight-loss injections) in public health-service advertising. Naming semaglutide goes beyond the brief; the class references implement it. Escalate to Marcus/legal: how the practice wants to handle medical-weight-management references site-wide (this affects the briefs, not just these drafts).
