+> **What are gastric bypass outcomes after 10 years?** Ten-year outcomes vary between individuals. Some people maintain weight or health changes, while others experience weight regain or need ongoing treatment; long-term vitamin, mineral and medical follow-up remains important. Your surgeon can discuss the evidence and how your health and follow-up plan affect expectations.
+
+Why it matters: A measured long-term answer is more useful than implying that early weight-loss averages continue unchanged for a decade.
+
