+
+> Delete this drafting label; do not publish it.
+
+> Alt
+
+> Delete this drafting label; do not publish it.
+
+Why it matters: "Conversion CTA headline" and "Alt" are writer scaffolding, not patient-facing content. Keep the corrected gastric-bypass CTA, but remove both labels.
